			"notes": "## Export a player's history\n\nThe player profile now has an **⬇ Export** button that saves that player's logged messages to a text file.\n\n- **Context**: set `context ± N` to also include **N messages before and after each of their messages, from everyone**, so you get the surrounding conversation rather than isolated lines. Overlapping windows are merged, so nothing is duplicated.\n- The player's own lines are marked with `>>` so they stand out from the surrounding chat.\n- Respects the active search filter, and the export header records the player, server, context setting, search, timestamp and line count."
		},
