			"notes": "## Network access & optional password\n\n- The dashboard now listens on **all network interfaces** (`0.0.0.0`), so it's reachable from other devices at `http://<your-ip>:25534` and can be **port-forwarded** directly.\n- Added an **optional password**, configurable in-game via **Mod Menu → ChatScope → Settings** (or `config/chatscope.json`). Leave it empty for open access (default). The password is read live, so changes apply without a restart.\n- [Cloth Config](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config) is bundled (no separate install); [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) is optional and only needed for the in-game settings button.\n\n> Only expose the dashboard to people you trust — set a password if you port-forward it.\n\n## Install\nDrop `chatscope-1.0.1.jar` and [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) into your Minecraft 1.21.11 `mods` folder. Add [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) too if you want the in-game settings button."
		},
